    LLM: 'Game: Kingen. Logic: Compendium trick-taking with alternating negative and positive rounds.',
    Player: "Kingen (also known as King) is a Belgian and French trick-taking game played by four individuals. It is a 'compendium' game where a full session consists of a series of rounds with different objectives.",
